<div class="w-full flex-1 py-10">
  <a href="/resources/" class="nav-link mb-4 inline-block">← Resources</a>

  <h1>DIY Team Building</h1>
  <p class="mb-2">48 activities take your team from first encounters to a thriving, self-aware collaboration with 1 hour / week.</p>
  <p>
    The sequence is deliberate: early activities build
    trust and shared identity, middle activities add structure and honest
    feedback, later activities deepen conflict skills and team maturity. Each
    activity stands alone, but together they form a complete development arc.
    Work through them in order, at your own pace: one activity per week keeps
    the momentum without overwhelming the schedule.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every activity is grounded in the principles of systems thinking, shared
    understanding, and productive differentiation. The theory section of each
    activity explains the mechanism behind it and connects it to earlier work, so you can see how your team grows from one activity to the next.
  </p>
</div>

